msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Nodi hiyo ya GPU au GPU hiyo haipo, au iko kwenye kifaa ambacho huna ruhusa ya kukifikia."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Hoja ya data ya GPU haikuweza kuongezwa kwenye kifaa. Hakikisha kuwa violezo vya programu-jalizi vimesakinishwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Kifaa: kifaa cha nodi kilifutwa, kwa hivyo nodi inaweza kuzimwa pekee."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Kifaa: chagua kifaa kilichopo cha Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Kifaa: kifaa hiki tayari ni nodi ya GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "Nodi ya GPU ilihifadhiwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "Nodi ya GPU haikuweza kuhifadhiwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Nodi ya GPU iliondolewa. Kifaa chake cha Cacti kiliachwa mahali pake."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Nodi ya GPU haikuondolewa kwa sababu kumbukumbu za GPU ni zake. Izime badala yake; kumbukumbu za GPU hazifutwi kamwe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPU sasa ni ya nodi ambapo ilionekana, pamoja na historia yake."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU inabaki na nodi yake iliyorekodiwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU itaondoka kwenye hoja ya data wakati wa kuorodhesha upya kunakofuata. Grafu zake na faili za RRD zinahifadhiwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "GPU isiyopo pekee ndiyo inayoweza kuondolewa kwenye hoja ya data."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Kuunda kifaa kunahitaji ruhusa ya kudhibiti vifaa vya Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Maelezo: ingiza hadi vibambo 150 vinavyoweza kuchapishwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Jina la kipangishi: ingiza jina la kipangishi au anwani ya IP."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Kiolezo cha kifaa cha GPU Node hakijasakinishwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Kifaa hakikuhifadhiwa: akaunti yako huenda isione vifaa inavyounda. Mwombe msimamizi akiunde."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Kifaa hakikuweza kuondolewa baada ya ufikiaji kukataliwa. Mwombe msimamizi akiondoe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Kifaa na nodi yake ya GPU vimeundwa. Weka mipangilio ya SNMP ya kifaa kwenye ukurasa wa kifaa hicho."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "Kifaa hakikuweza kuundwa; angalia kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

