#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Kuhifadhi huongeza hoja ya data ya GPU kwenye kifaa, huku uorodheshaji upya wa kiotomatiki wa Cacti ukiwa umezimwa: programu-jalizi huorodhesha upya baada ya kila badiliko la GPU. Sanidi wakala wa SNMP wa kifaa kwanza; angalia docs/node-setup.md."

