#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "GPU isiyopo hubaki kuwa faharasa ya hoja ya data, kwa hivyo grafu zake na faili za RRD hubaki zimeambatishwa na kuonyesha pengo. Kuiondoa kwenye hoja ya data husimamisha hali hiyo: wakati wa kuorodhesha upya kunakofuata Cacti haiorodheshi tena, grafu zake huacha kusasishwa na vyanzo vyake vya data huonyeshwa kama vilivyoachwa bila mzazi, na faili zake za RRD na grafu huhifadhiwa hadi utakapozifuta. Kumbukumbu ya GPU hubaki, na GPU hurejea kwenye hoja ya data ikiripotiwa tena."

