#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Mikusanyo mfululizo iliyofanikiwa ambayo lazima ikose GPU kabla haijawekwa alama kuwa haipo, kuanzia 1 hadi 100. Mkusanyo ulioshindwa, au unaoripoti hakuna GPU, hauhesabiwi kamwe. GPU zisizokuwepo huhifadhi kumbukumbu na historia yake na hazifutwi kiotomatiki kamwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Ukusanyaji wa GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Ipitwe na Wakati Baada ya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Sekunde baada ya zana kuchukua sampuli ambapo thamani zake zitaacha kuchorwa kwenye grafu, kuanzia 60 hadi 86400. Thamani ya zamani zaidi huripotiwa kama isiyojulikana, kwa hivyo ukusanyaji uliosimama huonekana kama pengo, kamwe si kama mstari tambarare. Thamani ya umri wa GPU huendelea kuhesabu ili iweze kutoa tahadhari."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Sakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Weka Majedwali ya Programu-jalizi Wakati wa Kusakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, kuondoa programu-jalizi huhifadhi kumbukumbu zake za nodi na GPU. Ondoa uteuzi ili kuondoa programu-jalizi kuzifuta; zisafirishe kwanza kutoka GPU Nodes. Vifaa vya Cacti, vyanzo vya data, grafu, na faili za RRD haziguswi kamwe kwa vyovyote vile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Ondoa vipengee vya Cacti vya programu-jalizi wakati wa kuondoa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, kuondoa programu-jalizi pia huondoa kiolezo cha kifaa cha GPU, hoja ya data, kiolezo cha data, na violezo vya grafu ilivyoagiza, kila kimoja pale tu ambapo hakuna kitu nje ya programu-jalizi kinachokitumia, na XML ya hoja ya data ya GPU iliyoandika, ikiwa tu faili haijabadilishwa. Haifuti kamwe faili za RRD, vifaa, grafu, au vyanzo vya data; violezo ambavyo bado vinatumika na hivyo huhifadhiwa."

